Hi Craig,

You need to put RTools make utilities on the system path. You can do this manually using your Advanced Systems Settings or using R - instructions are found here <https://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/> under the heading Putting RTools on the Path.

Cheers,
Andrea

